TrackMe 1.7.3

• The map stays where you put it. Pan or zoom out while recording — it no longer drags you back a second later. Tap the recentre button when you want it to follow you again.

• Tap any rider in your group to jump straight to them on the map.

• A short trail behind each rider in your group shows which way they are heading.

• Long rides are no longer cut in two. A ride of any length now saves and syncs in one piece.

• Deleting a ride now removes every part of it from the cloud, not just the summary.
